+ * Xiaomi Mi 9T "davinci" (SM7150 + PM6150 QGauge, battery profile f10_swd):
+ *
+ *   1. the profile lookups of the kernel driver (qg-profile-lib.c, /dev/qg_battery)
+ *   2. the closed-source QTI userspace QG daemon inside /vendor/bin/hvdcp_opti
