+ *   3. the kernel side of qpnp-qg (Xiaomi lineage-24.0 tree): PON SOC,
+ *      process_udata_work, qg_adjust_sys_soc, msoc scaling, hold-full /
+ *      linearize, Xiaomi smooth tracking and force-shutdown.
